zonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F877fe0fd-8664-4d8b-9524-4bf8eb9c7c3d_3664x2062.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!HMt7!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F877fe0fd-8664-4d8b-9524-4bf8eb9c7c3d_3664x2062.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!HMt7!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F877fe0fd-8664-4d8b-9524-4bf8eb9c7c3d_3664x2062.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Good night all.  I’ll let you know how the eTNS (and the methotrexate rechallenge) goes!</p><p>Getting old…not glamorous.  But someone has to do it. </p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p>","text":"The frontier psychiatrists might as well be gonzo self care journalism for the 40 over 40 set. The story thus far:\n\nShare The Frontier Psychiatrists\n\nYour author, Owen Muir, M.D. started using the Monarch eTNS device for his ADHD. He also has and awful autoimmune flare, and developed Hemicrania continua (half my face is Burning!) and developed ptosis—a slight droop or my right eyelid from super slight bells’ palsy.\n\nMy face looks like this. So I stopped the monarch device for two nights just in case.\n\nSaw my rheumatologist. This was my face a month ago for reference:\n\nNon droopy eye lid. Cute family too!\n\nTonight, my Saint of a wife Carlene made sure I put the Monarch eTNS device back on!\n\n“You are much calmer when you use it!”\n\nI will take that advice. It’s back!\n\nGood night all. I’ll let you know how the eTNS (and the methotrexate rechallenge) goes!\n\nGetting old…not glamorous. But someone has to do it.\n\nSubscribe now"}